 - **Shadow build** — the updater's rebuild of the similarity cache into `similarity-cache.next.db`, copied from the active `similarity-cache.db`, while the Engine keeps serving. It replaces the active file with one `os.replace` only after passing an integrity, schema and source-count gate. The replaced file is kept as `similarity-cache.prev.db`, by hardlink or, where linking fails, by copy. Running Engines pick up the new file without a restart, because the active path now names a different inode (ADR-0008).
